      "description": "Watch PSV Eindhoven vs Groningen highlights and goals from Eredivisie on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 23, 2026. A commanding comeback at the Philips Stadion In a fixture that captured the attention of Eredivisie followers, PSV Eindhoven welcomed FC Groningen on August 23, 2026 , for a match that promised tactical intrigue. Both sides arrived with high aspirations, looking to stamp their authority early in the proceedings. An early scare and a clinical turnaround The visitors from FC Groningen stunned the crowd by taking the lead in the 9th minute through Brynjolfur Andersen Willumsson , who capitalized on an assist from Thom van Bergen . The joy was short-lived, however, as PSV Eindhoven leveled the score just two minutes later following an unfortunate own goal by Thijmen Blokzijl . Riding the momentum, Ivan Perisic put the hosts in front in the 35th minute, turning the tide before the interval. Second-half surge Coming out for the second half, PSV Eindhoven showed why they are a formidable force in football . They secured a penalty in stoppage time of the first half, which Ricardo Pepi clinically dispatched to extend the lead. The second half belonged entirely to the hosts, with Ivan Perisic bagging his brace in the 53rd minute and Sergino Dest adding a fifth shortly after. The match concluded with a dominant display, showcasing the technical superiority of the home side. Goals : Brynjolfur Andersen Willumsson (9'), Thijmen Blokzijl (11' OG), Ivan Perisic (35', 53'), Ricardo Pepi (45+3'), Sergino Dest (56'). Yellow Cards : Ruben van Bommel (21'), Mark Csinger (45+2')."
