d Victory As the clock ticked deep into stoppage time, FC Groningen relied on their superior possession—controlling 59% of the ball—to navigate the storm. The home side's defense, led by timely interventions from Tyrique Mercera and goalkeeper Etienne Vaessen , held firm against a barrage of long throws and crosses. When the final whistle blew, the 22,525 fans in attendance celebrated a deserved 2-1 victory, ending a match that tested the nerves of both sets of supporters."
